<title>SPAIN: Spanish bonds close lower after roll-over day.</title>
<headline>Spanish bonds close lower after roll-over day.</headline>
<text>
<p>1615 GMT - Bonos erased all early gains, ending lower on the last trading day for the December 10-year future contract</p>
<p>* 10-yr 8.8 pct T-bond 112.39 vs 108.24, yield 6.94 vs 6.96</p>
<p>* Dec future 112.20 vs 112.22 at Friday's close</p>
<p>* March future 111.60 vs 111.81 at Friday's close</p>
